{
  "kind": "mip0018-case",
  "schema": 1,
  "id": "U1",
  "title": "Existing-contract upgrade (S6): deploy a token without an emitting circuit, mint, VerifierKeyInsert(publishMetadata), publish",
  "demonstrates": "MIP \"Existing contracts\": a maintenance VerifierKeyInsert adds publishMetadata() to a deployed kind-1 token; the event is bound to the ORIGINAL address, so the color of the coins minted before the upgrade is the identity's color; address, domainSep, coins and the other circuit stay as they were. A key outside the maintenance committee is refused.",
  "conclusion": "same contract address before/after; entry points {mint} → {mint, publishMetadata} with the mint key unchanged; ledger data unchanged; 1 kind-1 identity (\"Legacy Token\", \"LGCY\", 6) whose color = the color of the coins wallet 1 received from the pre-upgrade mint; the scanner finds that mint before the insert and lookup resolves the color to the new metadata; the insert signed by another key is refused before submission and, forced, rejected by the node.",
  "mip": {
    "commit": "b147c627e1bb15b5d15cc73cf30c2a36afd34dbb",
    "eventName": "mip-0018:token-metadata[v1]"
  },
  "source": {
    "example": "examples/upgrade-existing-contract",
    "deployed": "examples/upgrade-existing-contract/legacy/LegacyToken.compact",
    "upgrade": "examples/upgrade-existing-contract/upgrade/LegacyTokenMetadata.compact",
    "guide": "docs/upgrade-guide.md"
  },
  "notes": [
    "domainSep = pad(32, \"mip-0018:example:upgrade\") (a LegacyToken constructor argument; publishMetadata() reads it from the ledger).",
    "The wrong-signer key is a throwaway ledger sampleSigningKey() in the signer state directory (0600) — never wallet material; it is not in the contract's one-key committee.",
    "On Stagenet only the free negatives run (owner plan S6b): the refused insert (no transaction) and the forced one the node rejects (no fee). The paid overwrite attempts (≈ 0.6 DUST each) are proven on the local chain (examples/upgrade-existing-contract/README.md).",
    "{firstHeight} = the deploy height − 1 and {lastHeight} = the highest inclusion height of this case's record: the scan covers the mint before the upgrade and the publish after it."
  ],
  "placeholders": {
    "{net}": "network options (Stagenet: --network stagenet)",
    "{signer}": "wallet 1's signer options (mnemonic file, wallet cache)",
    "{signer2}": "wallet 2's signer options, with its OWN private-state file",
    "{case}": "this case folder",
    "{out}": "where records and observations are written (Stagenet: this case folder)",
    "{out:<ID>}": "another case's output folder"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "deploy",
      "runner": "signer",
      "wallet": "wallet1",
      "argv": [
        "deploy",
        "{net}",
        "{signer}",
        "--adapter",
        "examples/upgrade-existing-contract/legacy/mip0018.adapter.ts",
        "--args",
        "[\"0x6d69702d303031383a6578616d706c653a757067726164650000000000000000\"]",
        "--record",
        "{out}/record.json"
      ],
      "expectExit": 0,
      "submits": "deploy"
    },
    {
      "id": "mint",
      "runner": "signer",
      "wallet": "wallet1",
      "argv": [
        "call",
        "{net}",
        "{signer}",
        "--record",
        "{out}/record.json",
        "--circuit",
        "mint",
        "--args",
        "[{\"bytes\":{\"$signer\":\"coinPublicKey\"}},\"1000\",{\"$random\":32}]",
        "--step",
        "mint"
      ],
      "expectExit": 0,
      "submits": "call",
      "note": "owner mint of 1000 shielded coins to wallet 1 (emits nothing)"
    },
    {
      "id": "wallet-status",
      "runner": "signer",
      "wallet": "wallet1",
      "argv": [
        "wallet",
        "status",
        "{net}",
        "{signer}",
        "--json"
      ],
      "expectExit": 0,
      "stdout": "wallet-status.json",
      "note": "wallet 1 holds the 1000 coins: their color as the wallet SDK sees it, BEFORE the upgrade"
    },
    {
      "id": "inspect-before",
      "runner": "wallet-free",
      "script": "examples/upgrade-existing-contract/scripts/inspect.ts",
      "argv": [
        "--network",
        "stagenet",
        "--record",
        "{out}/record.json",
        "--ledger",
        "examples/upgrade-existing-contract/managed/LegacyToken",
        "--ledger",
        "examples/upgrade-existing-contract/managed/LegacyTokenMetadata"
      ],
      "expectExit": 0,
      "stdout": "observed-inspect-before.json",
      "note": "wallet-free snapshot before the upgrade: entry points {mint}, one-key authority (counter 0), ledger-data hash"
    },
    {
      "id": "wrong-signer",
      "runner": "signer",
      "wallet": "wallet1",
      "argv": [
        "upgrade",
        "{net}",
        "{signer}",
        "--record",
        "{out}/record.json",
        "--source",
        "examples/upgrade-existing-contract/upgrade",
        "--circuit",
        "publishMetadata",
        "--maintenance-key-file",
        "/run/mip0018/state/u1-wrong-signer.key",
        "--no-call",
        "--step",
        "wrong-signer"
      ],
      "expectExit": 1,
      "expectOutput": "not in the contract's committee",
      "note": "insert signed by a key outside the committee: refused before submission (exit 1, no transaction)"
    },
    {
      "id": "wrong-signer-forced",
      "runner": "signer",
      "wallet": "wallet1",
      "argv": [
        "upgrade",
        "{net}",
        "{signer}",
        "--record",
        "{out}/record.json",
        "--source",
        "examples/upgrade-existing-contract/upgrade",
        "--circuit",
        "publishMetadata",
        "--maintenance-key-file",
        "/run/mip0018/state/u1-wrong-signer.key",
        "--no-call",
        "--step",
        "wrong-signer-forced",
        "--force"
      ],
      "expectExit": 1,
      "expectOutput": "Custom error: 135",
      "note": "the same, --force: the node rejects it (1010 Invalid Transaction, Custom error 135 = InvalidCommitteeSignature; local evidence) — not included, no fee"
    },
    {
      "id": "upgrade",
      "runner": "signer",
      "wallet": "wallet1",
      "argv": [
        "upgrade",
        "{net}",
        "{signer}",
        "--record",
        "{out}/record.json",
        "--source",
        "examples/upgrade-existing-contract/upgrade",
        "--circuit",
        "publishMetadata",
        "--step",
        "upgrade"
      ],
      "expectExit": 0,
      "submits": "verifier-key-insert+call",
      "note": "preflight (layout, decode, authority) → VerifierKeyInsert(publishMetadata, v4) signed by the deploy-time maintenance key (0600 private state) → publishMetadata() through the upgrade-only build (record steps upgrade:insert, upgrade:call)"
    },
    {
      "id": "inspect-after",
      "runner": "wallet-free",
      "script": "examples/upgrade-existing-contract/scripts/inspect.ts",
      "argv": [
        "--network",
        "stagenet",
        "--record",
        "{out}/record.json",
        "--ledger",
        "examples/upgrade-existing-contract/managed/LegacyToken",
        "--ledger",
        "examples/upgrade-existing-contract/managed/LegacyTokenMetadata"
      ],
      "expectExit": 0,
      "stdout": "observed-inspect-after.json",
      "note": "after: entry points {mint, publishMetadata}, mint key unchanged, counter 1, ledger-data hash unchanged"
    },
    {
      "id": "verify-publish",
      "runner": "wallet-free",
      "argv": [
        "verify",
        "{net}",
        "--record",
        "{out}/record.json",
        "--step",
        "upgrade:call",
        "--expect",
        "@{case}/expect/publish.json",
        "--wait",
        "120",
        "--json"
      ],
      "expectExit": 0,
      "stdout": "observed-verify-publish.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "list",
      "runner": "wallet-free",
      "argv": [
        "list",
        "{net}",
        "--record",
        "{out}/record.json",
        "--expect",
        "@{case}/expected.json",
        "--json"
      ],
      "expectExit": 0,
      "stdout": "observed-list.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "index",
      "runner": "wallet-free",
      "argv": [
        "index",
        "{net}",
        "--from-height",
        "{firstHeight}",
        "--to-height",
        "{lastHeight}",
        "--state",
        "{out}/index",
        "--json"
      ],
      "expectExit": 0,
      "stdout": "index-summary.json",
      "note": "{firstHeight} = the deploy height − 1; {lastHeight} = the highest inclusion height of the record"
    },
    {
      "id": "lookup",
      "runner": "wallet-free",
      "argv": [
        "lookup",
        "{net}",
        "--record",
        "{out}/record.json",
        "--domain-sep",
        "0x6d69702d303031383a6578616d706c653a757067726164650000000000000000",
        "--kind",
        "1",
        "--state",
        "{out}/index",
        "--json"
      ],
      "expectExit": 0,
      "stdout": "lookup.json",
      "note": "the color of the pre-upgrade coins → (this contract, domainSep, kind 1) → the metadata published after the upgrade"
    },
    {
      "id": "wallet-status-after",
      "runner": "signer",
      "wallet": "wallet1",
      "argv": [
        "wallet",
        "status",
        "{net}",
        "{signer}",
        "--json"
      ],
      "expectExit": 0,
      "stdout": "wallet-status-after.json",
      "note": "wallet 1 still holds the 1000 coins of that color"
    }
  ],
  "expected": "expected.json",
  "recheck": {
    "verify": [
      {
        "record": "record.json",
        "step": "upgrade:call",
        "expect": "expect/publish.json"
      }
    ],
    "list": [
      {
        "record": "record.json",
        "expect": "expected.json"
      }
    ],
    "noTransaction": [
      {
        "record": "record.json",
        "step": "wrong-signer:insert"
      }
    ],
    "colors": [
      {
        "record": "record.json",
        "domainSep": "0x6d69702d303031383a6578616d706c653a757067726164650000000000000000",
        "kind": 1,
        "index": "index",
        "wallet": "wallet-status.json",
        "expectIdentity": {
          "domainSep": "0x6d69702d303031383a6578616d706c653a757067726164650000000000000000",
          "kind": 1,
          "colored": true,
          "common": {
            "name": "Legacy Token",
            "symbol": "LGCY",
            "decimals": 6
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
